Subject: [PATCH 072/104] =?UTF-8?q?refactor:=20=E6=B6=88=E9=99=A4=20server?=
 =?UTF-8?q?.c=20=E4=B8=AD=E7=9A=84=20goto=20=E8=B7=A8=E5=9D=97=E8=B7=B3?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E8=BD=AC=20(M2)?=
